# RG1 = G1, room owner o (k2: phase 2 after the training, K0-K2, COUNTER 7 = 1). seed_story writes its story as the server's
# merges leave it (no 503: no story saved before round G-core holds it), so only the rebase at the room's open can give
# the room story 503 (the story shows the training: COUNTER 7 and the key items). o plays into its lobby and waits
# there while the guest plays.
campaign until stage=stagml11
talk until control,frames>=60
log in the lobby
idle until frames>=120 fail flag:503=0
log 503 in the owner's lobby
idle until frames>=6000
